sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor E as Executive
    participant W as Web app + API
    participant A as Agent service
    participant V as Vertex AI
    participant P as Postgres (agent schema)

    E->>W: "Delete all reports mentioning Diesel"
    W->>A: POST /turn
    A->>V: classify (cheap model)
    V-->>A: report_library · delete · scope = entity · "Diesel"
    A->>P: owner's reports (id, title, description, entities)
    A->>V: select matching reports (cheap model)
    V-->>A: report IDs + search terms
    A->>P: full-text match of terms over search_text (owner only)
    A->>A: union of both lists ∩ owner's IDs → snapshot of exact IDs
    A->>P: checkpoint: pending delete (snapshot) · interrupt
    A-->>W: confirmation request: list of 3 reports
    W-->>E: "3 reports will be permanently deleted" + list

    alt executive confirms
        E->>W: confirm
        W->>A: POST /turn (resumes the interrupt)
        A->>P: one transaction: DELETE id IN snapshot AND owner = executive · INSERT audit_log (who, when, IDs, count)
        A-->>W: "3 reports deleted"
    else anything else
        E->>W: any other message
        W->>A: POST /turn
        A->>P: clear pending delete
        A-->>W: "Deletion cancelled." + the message answered as a normal turn
    end
